    {
      "GroupDto": {
        "GroupName": "XORA",
        "Description": "NAND reading (inputs A and B, BIAS constantly on) of the shipped 'Logic Gate NOT-NAND' gate, the C1-side arm of the three-NAND XOR: it computes NAND(C1, NAND(C1, C0)). The whole counter composes at the logic layer, not optically: every gate's truth table is extracted once in isolation against its threshold 0.125, so each stage restores clean 0/1 levels by construction — there is deliberately no multi-stage passive optical cascade here.",
        "Identifier": "group_17ea8df15ba552a5a267503b735ff33c",
        "IdGuid": "8d3db185-be71-52ec-bf92-fef225e2dfe1",
